-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §63 (part יד, הרחבת הוראות ההסכם): the
-- organisation applies to the Minister of Industry, Trade and Labour for an
-- extension order extending the agreement, under §25 of the Collective
-- Agreements Law, to further employers of teaching employees in the upper
-- divisions.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `63`

DECLARE `Oz section 63 action` IS ONE OF
    `apply to the Minister for an extension order extending the agreement`

-- ¶1: the parties agree that the organisation applies; no day is set
-- (convention dates.no-deadline). Whether the Minister extends it is his,
-- under §25 of the Collective Agreements Law, 1957, which is outside the
-- corpus and not among the sections encoded here (laws/).
@ref akn:art_63/p1
`applying for an extension order` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    MUST  `apply to the Minister for an extension order extending the agreement`

`why section 25 of the Collective Agreements Law is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק הסכמים קיבוציים, התשי\"ז-1957, סעיף 25"
